  "html": "<h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>生态智能硬件产品销售渠道</strong></span></h1><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1. 渠道优势：在线商城+线下门店</strong></span></h2><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1.1 在线商城</strong></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">比亚迪车主APP，微信小程序、车机端多端运营，专注于打造全场景智能化车生活产品聚集地。凭借正品保障与卓越服务，我们赢得了消费者的高度信赖，成为品质智慧生活的引领者。目前，车主APP已拥有</span><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>3000万+注册用户，日均UV 1000万+，百亿级年曝光量</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/063873d999844daba6bca68eb5e99f9b.png?auth_key=1795677431-2c33029959a84f9dae0e253ee0508622-0-b6c3df869cebc792559e0575a58d702d387c4fe153e205b52c1d9b8943195eb8\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 1031.00px;height: 520.30px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-1 在线商城渠道</span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1.2 线下门店</strong></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">积极拓展全国几千家线下门店渠道，将产品在店端完成铺货，融入用户的选车、购车、维保等用户旅程，打造以车为核心的生态产品展销模式；可实现千万量级的潜客覆盖，让产品与用户面对面。线下门店全年曝光量几十亿人次，用户可实车体验生态产品带来的用车便捷性、智能化、愉悦感。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/1b7e392c5b1f4dca8864483fd8b534e9.png?auth_key=1795677431-82d276dbd0ad4f6ab83eedbd329c5d72-0-42c7bc159077b805899f013fc9df831c1fc4f62407a724c00ce4e02108ce891a\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 991.00px;height: 410.67px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-2 线下门店展柜</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2. 营销赋能：多元策略驱动销售增长</strong></span></h2><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2.1 汽车发布会及购车权益</strong></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">比亚迪汽车一直致力于构建开放、共赢的生态联盟朋友圈。您的优质产品将有机会登上比亚迪汽车的发布会舞台，进行品牌宣传展示。与此同时，我们将把您的产品纳入比亚迪商城的满减活动范畴，使其成为购车权益的重要组成部分，促进比亚迪汽车及生态产品的销量增长，携手共创双赢局面。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/087988f44e904b9995d9231dcfdd55e9.png?auth_key=1795677431-8edccc7d5f494aab9b4207384f5e68d0-0-f29d5b517e592ae5671f8b963e8dcddf4faf53c2c29632fc6fbab9ac5f27a1d0\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 760.97px;height: 371.29px;\"> &nbsp; <img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/e9558a62d85949f6b61405fbf9884540.png?auth_key=1795677431-644fab60b278454ba12c8587fa4c0d64-0-9ca5274179e273d93baaeacfe1859369642ce4d9f8cfadbcff5b51649003e99c\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 207.95px;height: 372.60px;\"> &nbsp; </p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 2-1 发布会现场及购车权益</span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2.2 商城大促 IP：流量与曝光的双重盛宴</strong></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">借助疯狂迪粉日、618、双十一等大促 IP，车主APP-商城通过站内多样化玩法和站外流量联动，显著提升商家销售额。可提供多种促销工具，如满减、满赠、折扣、盲盒等，帮助商家吸引用户购买。例如，OPPO WatchX2 Mini 在全渠道推广下获得亿级曝光；疯狂迪粉日活动期间，硬件商品整体营收较非活动日提升 55%。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/44ceb0f99ea7469f83ff769bade877a1.png?auth_key=1795677431-fc397dcd75c142178fff6bac1a16906c-0-c0e644ed83660fc59e4be1233797bc07fa8ce6d3c701ecc9477248761361437e\" alt=\"5.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 355.92px;height: 355.92px;\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/526dc73e2d7645d3a948a4c6b7eebdd4.png?auth_key=1795677431-3b7b04589f84499396c09e804a11222d-0-d58bccedf463a46d1162c3a675ddefc0960ac15afe6d406b8f22b587f1906a59\" alt=\"6.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 560.97px;height: 367.22px;\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 2-2 OPPO WatchX2 Mini 活动推广效果</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/4f1be0c30a25448ab7c7a7c859bd0d3c.png?auth_key=1795677431-92d33b0447e84e84911485523c904eb4-0-9f5bc460103e6d7348b0873629d4dbc7401b1c7301081bf10c0b514572a22322\" alt=\"7.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 309.95px;height: 309.95px;\"> &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/a93e37898b7246a3afd55e02ba8067a8.png?auth_key=1795677431-21f40340de2c4d9eb14c5cc90508ec83-0-94b880573bd5b2967cae682d6dc21defd2bf8d002985feddb8ab98b1b43d0311\" alt=\"8.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 656.96px;height: 311.55px;\"> &nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 2-3 DiLink麦克风欢享版 活动推广效果</span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2.3 精准营销</strong></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">以大模型算法通过手机APP、车机、短信精准推送智能化商品、服务信息。</span></p><table style=\"width: auto;table-layout: fixed;height:568.015625\"><colgroup contentEditable=\"false\"><col width=90></col><col width=376></col><col width=407></col><col width=435></col></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">宣发渠道</span></th><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">APP Push/短信</span></th><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">车机端</span></th><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">商城优惠券定向发放</span></th></tr><tr style=\"height: 72px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">简介</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">通过比亚迪APP Push、短信推送，为厂商将商品、服务的最新资讯，精准匹配至有对应需求的用户群体。</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">比亚迪车机端基于车辆状态、用户位置等信息，进行场景化的精准推送，实现“产品/服务主动找人”。</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">识别潜在用户，定向发放商城优惠券，以提升用户付费转化。查看路径：我的-我的卡券-商城优惠券</span></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 92px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">页面</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/873ae32a590f4031aefd7a4b0241a71a.png?auth_key=1795677431-b5777029392f4f1187bedc8f214a9022-0-012904388c5f2c58d26225cd20a5249082fc1aa69adea256c32bf6423d4e018a\" alt=\"表1-1.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 225.92px;height: 437.67px;\"></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/8e27da9047bc40cd808a67eab17a35ac.png?auth_key=1795677431-0f852752d1044eb7bea60e8f81156df5-0-23271ef0d40574401f7206b6f8a3c2532544ab0873394272d482e31c0a3baa39\" alt=\"表1-2.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/1babe1ab239b4ecfae44397e29d9983d.png?auth_key=1795677431-e26c380556034edb86c06734ad5de678-0-6cb6f8081c416a2d2f817cf979fbdc60ad39a47bd7a15f5d12f7ceb762d993d9\" alt=\"表1-3.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"><br></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2.4 品牌自有媒体矩阵</strong></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">官方宣发渠道覆盖微信公众号、微博、抖音及比亚迪APP社区、Banner等，以下为部分渠道举例：</span></p><table style=\"width: auto;table-layout: fixed;height:1938\"><colgroup contentEditable=\"false\"><col width=90></col><col width=374></col><col width=411></col><col width=434></col></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height: 30px\"><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">宣发渠道</span></th><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">比亚迪智慧生态公众号</span></th><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">比亚迪智慧生态视频号</span></th><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">比亚迪APP社区、Banners</span></th></tr><tr style=\"height: 238px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">访问地址</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/9363b7d84e874b2493a6a0f64e76556f.png?auth_key=1795677431-4722d7cdad5c4c419b9b6ae6749bc868-0-74c2ca5fe09c8fe7d0afd34efcd0b45efd3fe6020fecf1a576f1f162eaad75b4\" alt=\"表2-1.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 119.98px;height: 119.98px;\"></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/8302bccbb9524080bc7c7265acdde72f.png?auth_key=1795677431-b369615ea9664f90b5ef4f6d91d1497b-0-0729fd98c658ee5234568281897d314bce5326a655a131dadd38280430523400\" alt=\"表2-2.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 123.96px;height: 123.32px;\"></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: cen